id:                     DRAFT-bambootracker-qt6-executable-conan
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|test
phase:                  configuration|compilation|testing
error_signature:        Library '.*' not found in package|Error loading shared library|Unable to locate either Qt5 or Qt6|cmake_minimum_required.*CMake 4

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
severity:               2
category:               conan, cmake, qt6, packaging, testing
match_keywords:         pure executable, cpp_info.libs, test_package, offscreen, smoke, Qt6LinguistTools_DIR, Qt6Core5Compat_DIR, CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM, cmake_minimum_required
title:                  Qt6 纯可执行 GUI 包的 Conan 配方与 test_package 消费者模式
root_cause:             Qt6 GUI 纯可执行包（无 lib/ 产物）若在 package_info() 声明不存在的 cpp_info.libs，CMakeDeps 会生成指向缺失库的 target，导致 test_package find_package 报 "Library not found"；同时 Qt6Config 组件搜索受 PATHS 限定在 qtbase 前缀，LinguistTools/Core5Compat 需显式 DIR 供给；CMake 4.x 已移除 cmake_minimum_required <3.5 支持。
solution:               (1) package_info() 不声明虚假 cpp_info.libs（纯可执行包留空）；(2) test_package 改为运行安装的二进制 offscreen smoke（test.sh，QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen，Qt 初始化成功 rc=124 即通过），而非链接不存在的库；(3) generate() 用 tc.cache_variables 显式供给 Qt6LinguistTools_DIR / Qt6Core5Compat_DIR / CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 / CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH；(4) build() 用 Environment 供给 qtbase LD_LIBRARY_PATH 供 lrelease 运行期加载。
affected_scope:         Qt6/Qt5 GUI 纯可执行包（无库产物）的 Conan 2 配方与 test_package 消费者适配；CMake 4.x 工具链环境；OHOS aarch64 无头（offscreen）测试环境。
verification_cmd:       conan create 干净构建（G2 PASS）；test_package 执行 'BambooTracker offscreen init OK (rc=124)'；W3 Pass rate 100% (1/1)。
verification_result:    BambooTracker 0.6.5: Conan G0-G4 PASS；consumer offscreen smoke init OK rc=124；W3 100%；finish 真实退出码 0。
rec_priority:           1
